  "subject": {
    "id": "ccr12-activation-boundary",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Bind the scoped authority-grant implementation boundary.",
  "why": "Malleus Code exposed two missing commitments in the existing AuthorityGrant: the governed work scope and whether the grantee may delegate authority further. This revision activates one narrow Core change, preserves domain policy as the interpreter of scope ancestry and attenuation, and treats the ontology update as a hard fresh-epoch boundary instead of weakening historical identity checks."
}
